# Hand-maintained ledgers — the canonical state file, the go-live tracker, and
# the marketing scratch dir. Appended by hand every session; reflowing them
# would just re-break the whole-tree `prettier --check .` (the staging deploy
# runs it over the full checkout) on the next manual edit. Not code.
#
# `/marketing/` is ANCHORED. These patterns use gitignore semantics, where a
# bare `marketing/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth — which
# silently exempted all 48 source files in packages/web/src/marketing (the
# whole founding-offer and campaign surface) from the format gate, while
# `prettier --check .` still reported the tree clean.
